  "body": "Move the specifications for the `VideoPlaybackQuality` interface and the `HTMLVideoElement»getVideoPlaybackQuality()` method from the _Media Playback Quality_ specification at https://w3c.github.io/media-playback-quality/ into the HTML standard.\r\n\r\nThat interface and method:\r\n- are implemented in all current engines \r\n- have some tests at https://wpt.fyi/results/media-playback-quality (minimal ones, just for the IDL conformance)\r\n- are documented in MDN at https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/VideoPlaybackQuality and https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLVideoElement/getVideoPlaybackQuality\r\n\r\nRelated: https://github.com/w3c/whatwg-coord/issues/8",
